<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGA, Societe Generale Acceptance NV said on Monday it had issued 30 million American style call warrants on a basket of five red chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd	   0.90  shrs</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd		    1.80  shrs</p>
<p> Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd		5.70  shrs</p>
<p> Citic Pacific Ltd			    0.45  shrs</p>
<p> Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd	 0.50  shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$97.735	 PREMIUM	 17.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$1.720	  GEARING	 5.68x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   19.MAY.98	 MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$97.735</p>
<p> LISTING		LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
